    "description": "An enhanced version of JobStack is now available! Please download the new and improved JobStack for Work to continue your job search: https://bit.ly/JobStack-Work\r\n\r\nJobStack is a job finder app that helps workers find short term, flexible jobs & gigs in their area that match their skills and fit their schedule. With JobStack you are in control of your work schedule and choose when to work. Start your job search now!\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s what you can expect when using the JobStack app:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Easy onboarding\r\n\u2022 Choose your preferences & add your skills\r\n\u2022 Chose the jobs that work best for you\r\n\u2022 Get paid quickly\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Find jobs near you\r\n\u2022 Get work that fits your schedule\r\n\u2022 Access more relevant jobs every day\r\n\u2022 Our app gives you access to a variety of jobs so that you can choose ones which fit your skill set and work schedule.\r\n\u2022 Download JobStack today.",
